{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33704","headline":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 三 · 李骘","name":"读惠山若冰师集因题故院三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景物搜求歇，山云放纵飞。\n树寒烟鹤去，池静水龙归。\n暗榻尘飘满，阴檐月到稀。\n何年灯焰尽，风动影堂扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李骘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}